# A figure walking into the box of the sparks at a pillar (catacombs of
# the Theurgists' hall, map 37) makes a cycle in the paint order; the
# floor behind him must still be painted before him, not over his head
args: --map 37 --pos 10100,5100,64
do: t1;place:1,3,10299,4927,64;t1;pickat:413,173
expect: pickat 413,173: id 31574 shape    1 frame   3 at 10299,4927,64 flags 0000 q 0 npc 0 map 37 parent 0 family 6 [s] pad 2x2x5
